        "PMC8074761::web::001::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is an equivalent-atomic-fraction substitution of V for Hf, converting HfMoTaTiZr to nominally equiatomic VMoTaTiZr.",
